  "instructions": [
    "Heat the olive oil in a large pot over medium heat.",
    "Add the onion and garlic and cook until softened, about 5 minutes.",
    "Add the mushrooms, zucchini, and eggplant and cook until the vegetables are tender, about 10 minutes.",
    "Add the cabbage and cook until wilted, about 5 minutes.",
    "Add the breadcrumbs, Parmesan cheese, caster sugar, and tomato paste, and stir to combine.",
    "Pour in the chicken broth and bring to a simmer.",
    "Reduce heat to low and let cook for 20 minutes, stirring occasionally.",
    "Serve hot, garnished with additional Parmesan cheese if desired."
